1
00:00:00,997 --> 00:00:04,037
(Penny:)No, you made that for you.
I want you to have it.

2
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:08,340
(Bernadette:)We know you're upset,
and you have every right to be...

3
00:00:08,505 --> 00:00:11,215
...but we'd like a second chance
to make things right.

4
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:12,846
(Penny:)We are really sorry.

5
00:00:13,009 --> 00:00:16,969
(Penny:)We were trying to think of some way to
show you how much we care about you.

6
00:00:17,472 --> 00:00:19,182
(Bernadette:)Which is why
it would mean so much...

7
00:00:19,349 --> 00:00:22,559
(Bernadette:)...if you would agree
to be the maid of honor at my wedding.

8
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:23,857
(Sheldon:)What?

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,020
(Amy:)Wait, is this some kind
of practical joke?

10
00:00:26,189 --> 00:00:30,569
Like in Norway when my "friends"
trapped me in a sauna with a horny otter?

11
00:00:34,447 --> 00:00:37,327
(Bernadette:)No. I... I want you
to be the maid of honor.

12
00:00:37,867 --> 00:00:38,947
(Amy:)Oh, my gosh.

13
00:00:39,452 --> 00:00:41,702
No one's ever asked me
to be the maid of honor.

14
00:00:41,871 --> 00:00:45,501
(Amy:)Well, that's not true.
Once, but then they all died.

15
00:00:47,877 --> 00:00:52,047
- So is that a yes?
- Yes, heh. Yes.

16
00:00:52,215 --> 00:00:54,005
(Amy:)Oh, my gosh, I...
I have so much to do.

17
00:00:54,175 --> 00:00:56,715
(Amy:)There's the bridal shower
and the bachelorette party.

18
00:00:56,886 --> 00:00:59,386
What should we do for the bachelorette?
Oh, I know.

19
00:00:59,556 --> 00:01:03,026
(Amy:)Go to a Native American sweat lodge,
take peyote, roll in mud...

